## How to Control or Disable Cookies

You can control and manage cookies in various ways. Most browsers allow you to refuse cookies or to delete cookies. The methods for doing so vary from one browser to another, and from one version to another. You can generally find instructions for managing cookies in your browser's help section.

## Changes to This Policy

